/local/home/saviotta/Projects/others/git-graph-plus/CHANGELOG.md
19:- **Fixup / Squash Scope** - Fixup and squash actions are now hidden for comm
its that aren't on the current branch, where they wouldn't apply.
36:- **Interactive Rebase Squash Messages** - Reordering a squash group no longe
r discards a manually edited combined commit message.
53:- **Create Squash Commit** - A companion "Create Squash Commit" action commit
s staged changes as a `squash!` of the selected commit, with the generated commi
t message previewed in the modal.
54:- **Interactive Rebase Autosquash** - The interactive rebase modal gained an
Autosquash toggle. When `fixup!`/`squash!` commits are present it is on by defau
lt and arranges them under their targets; turning it off restores the loaded ord
er. The modal stays a preview until "Start Rebase".
62:- **Commit Context Menu Regrouped** - Amend and Create Fixup/Squash Commit ar
e now grouped as staged-change edits, Save Patch moved into the Export/Copy grou
p, and Bisect actions merged into the compare/inspect group. The toolbar's right
-side icons were also reordered for a clearer layout.
93:- **Rebase & Squash Notification** - You are now notified after squashing com
mits or completing an interactive rebase, instead of the operation finishing sil
ently.
98:- **Squash & Cherry-pick Multiple Commits** - Select consecutive commits dire
ctly in the graph (Shift-click for a range, Ctrl/Cmd-click to toggle), then righ
t-click the selection to squash them into one or cherry-pick them all at once. S
quashing opens a dialog to edit the combined commit message and warns when a for
ce push will be required.
147:- **Multi-Line Rebase Messages** - Interactive rebase reword and squash now
preserve the full multi-line commit message instead of just the subject.
232:- **Interactive Rebase: Reword in Squash Groups** - A reword target followed
 by squash/fixup now honors the typed final message instead of git's combined-me
ssage default
321:- **Squash Merge** - Auto-commits on success; shows conflict resolution UI w
hen conflicts are detected
367:- **Reflog Sub-action Column** — Added a dedicated column for detailed Git o
perations like `amend`, `squash`, `cherry-pick`, and `rebase` stages
420:- Interactive rebase: squash and fixup now prompt for a final commit message
 inline; edit-pause mode pauses rebase for amending
498:- **Git flag badges**: Modal option labels show the underlying git flag (e.g
. `--no-ff`, `--squash`) for transparency

